bb_paragraph\" >침묵, 비명, 추락으로 변화하는 다중 엔딩.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“당신은 어떤 사람인가요?”라고 묻는 데 그치지 않고, 그 대답을 강요하는 이야기.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3700580\/extras\/38a6a34ca93770a07cddaf3598a41574.poster.avif?t=1772738975\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3700580\/extras\/38a6a34ca93770a07cddaf3598a41574.mp4?t=1772738975\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"인터랙티브 심리 호러 이야기. 흔적도 없이 사라진 지 5년 후, 한때 당신이 사랑이라 불렀던 여인이 침묵을 넘어 편지를 보낸다: “당신의 아이를 낳을 거예요.” 세 개의 막으로 이루어진 이 이야기에서, 집착과 기억, 신화가 얽힌 붕괴된 정신 세계로 내려가라.","supported_languages":"영어, 튀르키예어, 독일어","reviews":"“What I think impressed me the most, however? How one line of dialogue could completely throw your run under the bus, or save you from your potentially impending doom.”<br>Vice<br><br>“Livber: Smoke and Mirrors, everything appears filtered through a modern Gothic-like horror setting and tale.”<br>GameRant<br><br>“It will be interesting to see how Disco Elysium's lyrical style will transition to a horror game, but if the splash that it's made online is anything to go by, players are ravenous for more.”<br>PcGamesN<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3700580\/2e4b46dc470c8e925a6051edc723f4a6323c0b0d\/header.jpg?t=1772738975","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3700580\/a4e8247e73cb451939c7314167efb5175485bf5b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772738975","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3700580\/a4e8247e73cb451939c7314167efb5175485bf5b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772738975","website":"https:\/\/www.inevgames.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\